A||N||7||WhiteFieroBlur||Had a good first day of snow!||||10||
Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||11-28-2001||03:30 PM||||Well I woke up this morning to goto work and my car would not start. But after a few tries it did. I guess its cause of the cold. My battery mostly starts off really low in the red and squeels its belt over to the good side. The battery is good so I dunno whats wrong. Anyways I only got stuck like 1 time. just reversed and I was out. I think fieros do so well in the snow. I was so worried to. I drove all the way in second gear and first. Next year I am gonna have nice saved up snow tired just for winter. i seen so many people get stuck today. <P>how come on my moms 99 cadi her tires lock up in the snow and ice? Is this some kind of new thing with traction they put on cars? Its kinda scary cause the tires lock and you can do anything about it. <P>So whats everyones plans for this winter? Anyone have any great idea to have fun in the snow and winter?<p>[This message has been edited by WhiteFieroBlur (edited 11-28-2001).]||||reg||10
