Z||000006||WhiteFieroBlur||11-28-2001||05:31 PM||||ok everything I said I take it all back, I got in the house trying to dig my car out of the snow. I pulled into my street too early and hit a fresh patch of snow. I hate the snow, I wish it would all go away  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. I was digging like a dog on my knees trying to get my car outta the snow, till this guy pushed my lil fiero till I could get good traction to go. My tires all smell like burned rubber and I know my engine didn't like it, get reving to redline trying to get out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P> Grrr no more winter I'd rather deal with tornado season than this.||||reg||1
